 SOS HELP — Emergency Assistance Platform

SOSAide is an intelligent and assistance platform accessible through a mobile application that allows users to trigger an emergency alert, locate a person in need, contact emergency contacts, find nearby emergency centers, guide the person and their helpers, and provide routes — all in demo mode for the Impact Forge prototype.

«⚠️ DEMO MODE: No real calls are made to actual emergency services. Calls, SMS messages, and emergency centers are simulated or use test numbers.»

---

 Features

 SOS

- Clickable SOS button to trigger an emergency.
- Automatic location detection (GPS) displayed immediately on the map.
- 10-second countdown with a cancellation button.
- Emergency history: active ✅ / cancelled 🛑, including times and routes.

 Emergency Contacts

- Fields to add personal emergency contacts (name, phone number, relationship).
- One-click calling ("tel:") and SMS ("sms:").
- Automatic emergency SMS with a location link when an SOS is triggered.

 Emergency Centers

- Pre-integrated emergency numbers stored in the database.
- Nearby centers displayed according to the type of emergency (medical, assault, fire, accident, lost).
- Sorting by distance, map display, and Call button.
- Each center is accompanied by a route (🚗 car, 🚶 walking, 🚌 bus when available).

 Artificial Intelligence

- Analysis of emergency situations described by the user.
- Identification of the emergency type and recommendations.
- Provides appropriate emergency centers, routes, and available assistance.

 Helpers

- Receive the SOS alert.
- Access the shared location.
- Get a route to reach the person in need.

 Platform Flow

- Automatic calls to emergency centers (simulated in demo mode).
- SMS messages received from other platform users (demo flow).

